sections.wikitext:
Mysterious waterspouts and whirlpools on a river in France have been capsizing boats and almost drowning people. The [[Huntik Foundation]] believes a lost [[Titan]] called [[Gar-Ghoul]] is awakening, and its powers are causing these attacks. [[Dante Vale]], [[Lok Lambert]], [[Sophie Casterwill]], and [[Zhalia Moon]] go to France to investigate.

When the heroes reach the river, they are attacked by [[Suits]]. After defeating the Suits, the team takes a boat upriver and encounters the magical whirlpools, which cause them to crash. Luckily, they find a [[Cave of the Gargoyle|hidden cave]]! Inside, a stone gargoyle blasts them with jets of water that hit as hard as bullets. To make things worse, [[DeFoe|DeFoe’s]] team shows up and attacks them too! DeFoe uses the battle as a distraction to steal Gar-Ghoul’s [[Amulet]], but Lok discovers a secret chamber that may be more valuable than Gar-Ghoul.
{{clear}}

